From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bitpony <bitpony@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rockbase exp2: DTS-gated no_hs HS veto (50->25MHz) (archive, judged INEFFECTIVE)

Freeze root-cause experiment 2 (docs/rockbase-sdhci1-freeze-experiments-20261001.md S5.9).
Vetoes the high-speed (50MHz) switch on the derated sdhci1 instance by gating
the sdhci core HS capability grant on the DTS 'no_hs' property. Deployed
Image 5c71dbe8 / dtb c5bbb189; verdict: M1 15.2/h vs 12.2/h baseline =>
INEFFECTIVE, frequency axis dead. Reverted from the tree; this file is
the change archive only. Note: intermediate iterations (cap-sd-highspeed
removal alone, sdhci-caps-mask, host->caps clear at probe) were all no-ops;
only this core-guard gate actually forced 25MHz.
Signed-off-by: bitpony <bitpony@example.com>

--- a/drivers/mmc/host/sdhci.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/sdhci.c
@@ -4501,8 +4501,17 @@
 	if (host->quirks2 & SDHCI_QUIRK2_HOST_NO_CMD23)
 		mmc->caps &= ~MMC_CAP_CMD23;
 
-	if (host->caps & SDHCI_CAN_DO_HISPD)
-		mmc->caps |= MMC_CAP_SD_HIGHSPEED | MMC_CAP_MMC_HIGHSPEED;
+	if (host->caps & SDHCI_CAN_DO_HISPD) {
+		/* rockbase exp2 (2026-10-02): DTS-gated HS veto for the
+		 * derated instance (freeze root-cause experiment). Inert
+		 * unless the "no_hs" property is present. */
+		if (!device_property_present(mmc_dev(mmc), "no_hs"))
+			mmc->caps |= MMC_CAP_SD_HIGHSPEED |
+					MMC_CAP_MMC_HIGHSPEED;
+		else
+			pr_info("rockbase-exp2 %s: no_hs veto HS, mmc->caps=0x%x\n",
+				mmc_hostname(mmc), mmc->caps);
+	}
 
 	if ((host->quirks & SDHCI_QUIRK_BROKEN_CARD_DETECTION) &&
 	    mmc_card_is_removable(mmc) &&
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/canaan/k230-rockbase-lcd.dts
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/canaan/k230-rockbase-lcd.dts
@@ -85,7 +85,10 @@
 &mmc_sd1{
 	status = "okay";
 	no-1-8-v;
-	cap-sd-highspeed;
+	/* rockbase exp2 (2026-10-02): veto high-speed (50MHz) switch, card
+	 * stays at legacy 25MHz (freeze root-cause experiment, derated
+	 * instance). Consumed by the sdhci core HS-grant guard. */
+	no_hs;
 	mshc_ctrl_r = <0x00>;
 };
 
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/canaan/k230-rockbase.dts
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/canaan/k230-rockbase.dts
@@ -83,7 +83,10 @@
 &mmc_sd1{
 	status = "okay";
 	no-1-8-v;
-	cap-sd-highspeed;
+	/* rockbase exp2 (2026-10-02): veto high-speed (50MHz) switch, card
+	 * stays at legacy 25MHz (freeze root-cause experiment, derated
+	 * instance). Consumed by the sdhci core HS-grant guard. */
+	no_hs;
 	mshc_ctrl_r = <0x00>;
 };
 
